## Neural Network Integration

### Feature Extraction
```julia
function state_to_features(state::AbstractState)::Vector{Float32}
    features = extract_domain_features(state)
    
    # Validation requirements
    @assert !any(isnan.(features)) "Features contain NaN"
    @assert !any(isinf.(features)) "Features contain Inf"
    @assert length(features) > 0 "Empty feature vector"
    
    return Float32.(features)
end
```

### Policy Network Architecture
```julia
# Forward policy: state → action probabilities
forward_model = Chain(
    Dense(state_dim => hidden_dim, relu),
